/* Attd07Mapper.selectUserWorkPlanCd - PRAFTA-APP-007 D15 승인 직전 현재 근무계획 코드 캡처 */
SELECT WP.WORK_PLAN_CD
  FROM TB_USER_WORK_PLAN WP
 WHERE WP.CMPNY_CD = #{gvCmpnyCd}
   AND WP.SITE_CD  = #{siteCd}
   AND WP.USER_CD  = #{userCd}
   AND WP.WORK_YMD = #{workYmd}
 LIMIT 1

